WEBVTT

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.320
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.320
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:59.330 --> 01:04.500
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:59.330 --> 01:04.500
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

01:04.660 --> 01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

01:04.660 --> 01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.670
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.670
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

01:13.840 --> 01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

01:13.840 --> 01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

01:42.370 --> 01:50.580
ZABOERA'S SCHEME

01:53.300 --> 01:54.010
Zaboera!

01:54.010 --> 01:54.840
My Lord?

01:54.840 --> 01:57.720
Summon your Mystic Legion at once!

01:57.720 --> 01:58.510
What?!

01:58.510 --> 02:01.100
I'll summon my elite guards as well!

02:01.100 --> 02:08.020
We'll gather our remaining forces
and launch a mass offensive against Dai!

02:08.020 --> 02:13.490
Wait a minute, Lord Hadlar!
That plan already failed once!

02:13.490 --> 02:17.660
Dai's party cannot be defeated
with any regular tactics!

02:17.660 --> 02:21.490
Assassination through careful planning
would be better.

02:22.450 --> 02:25.710
Leave it to me.

02:25.710 --> 02:29.550
A victor is not one who is strong.

02:29.550 --> 02:35.920
A victor is one who survives
to the end by any means.

02:53.480 --> 02:55.110
Let her sleep.

02:55.110 --> 02:59.780
She's been using Fullheal nonstop
to tend to our wounds.

03:02.450 --> 03:06.910
It was a difficult fight.
We're lucky we all survived.

03:09.500 --> 03:10.340
What's wrong?

03:10.340 --> 03:12.960
The fight isn't over yet.

03:12.960 --> 03:16.670
Baran may be gone,
but the other Legion Commanders remain.

03:17.710 --> 03:23.060
We won't stand a chance
if we're attacked now. I'll stand guard.

03:23.060 --> 03:25.140
You can't in that condition!

03:25.140 --> 03:26.530
That's right.

03:26.530 --> 03:29.020
The half-dead should take it easy.

03:29.020 --> 03:30.130
Popp.

03:30.130 --> 03:32.730
Leave guard duty to me.

03:32.730 --> 03:38.160
What are you talking about?
If we're half-dead, you really were dead!

03:38.160 --> 03:40.700
You need rest the most!

03:40.700 --> 03:43.660
Actually, I'm not sure why,

03:43.660 --> 03:48.170
but I actually feel better than
before I died.

03:48.170 --> 03:49.790
Save your bravado.

03:50.370 --> 03:53.790
See for yourself if it's bravado.

03:59.250 --> 04:00.680
Was that a Sizz spell?

04:00.680 --> 04:05.180
That's impossible unless
you really focus your Magic Power.

04:05.180 --> 04:09.390
See? For some reason
I'm in tip-top shape today.

04:09.890 --> 04:13.690
Fine. It looks like
you're in the best shape among us.

04:13.690 --> 04:19.110
Don't worry about it.
If things get ugly, I'll give a shout.

04:21.780 --> 04:27.750
It's been said that drinking the legendary
Dragon's blood grants immortality.

04:27.750 --> 04:33.210
Perhaps Baran's blood has made
Popp's body stronger than before.

04:33.210 --> 04:34.870
Oh wow.

04:35.580 --> 04:39.130
Then if you drink my blood
will you all get stronger?

04:40.710 --> 04:43.680
Baran said
your blood is closer to a human's.

04:43.680 --> 04:49.300
Aww. I thought if I had that power,
I could keep anyone from dying.

04:52.390 --> 04:56.860
Don't worry, Dai. We won't die so easily.

04:56.860 --> 04:59.270
And that includes Popp.

05:02.990 --> 05:04.740
Don't worry.

05:04.740 --> 05:08.620
This is the least I can do to be useful.

05:09.830 --> 05:14.960
My suicide attack fails,
and I end up saved by my target.

05:14.960 --> 05:17.170
Talk about embarrassing.

05:17.170 --> 05:19.040
Next time, I won't miss!

05:21.670 --> 05:24.300
I'm not going to cast Megante again.

05:24.300 --> 05:27.050
I just meant I won't mess up.

05:28.720 --> 05:31.270
<i>I knew Popp was forcing himself.</i>

05:31.270 --> 05:35.480
I'll survive until the end.
I promised on the other side, didn't I?

05:37.350 --> 05:39.280
You don't remember?

05:39.280 --> 05:41.520
You really are a mystery.

05:43.690 --> 05:45.690
Are you our guardian or something?

05:46.150 --> 05:48.990
<i>Please don't push yourself any further.</i>

05:51.620 --> 05:53.700
Who's there?! Show yourself!

05:54.540 --> 05:57.160
Things sound rough. Need a hand?

05:57.750 --> 06:00.000
Th-That voice!

06:03.500 --> 06:04.840
Maam!

06:06.170 --> 06:09.720
I-Is it... Is it really you?!

06:10.050 --> 06:13.980
Have you forgotten
your friend's face already?

06:13.980 --> 06:16.100
Of course I haven't!

06:17.230 --> 06:21.240
<i>So that's Maam,
one of the Disciples of Avan.</i>

06:21.240 --> 06:24.820
<i>Popp looks so happy to see her.</i>

06:25.530 --> 06:26.570
<i>But...</i>

06:26.570 --> 06:29.660
What about your martial arts training?

06:29.660 --> 06:30.580
Huh?

06:30.580 --> 06:32.410
You're all trained up now?

06:32.410 --> 06:36.420
Oh, that.
I packed it in before I finished.

06:36.420 --> 06:38.420
I got worried about you guys.

06:38.420 --> 06:39.160
Huh?

06:40.330 --> 06:43.920
<i>Maam quit something before completing it?</i>

06:43.920 --> 06:46.960
<i>I don't know why, but I don't like her.</i>

06:47.920 --> 06:51.140
<i>There's something sinister about her.</i>

06:52.800 --> 06:56.890
<i>Goodness! I must be just jealous of her!</i>

06:57.890 --> 06:58.980
What's wrong?

06:58.980 --> 07:01.190
N-Nothing! Forget it!

07:01.190 --> 07:06.320
Let's go see Dai and Leona and the others!
They're in for a surprise!

07:08.690 --> 07:09.650
Huh?

07:10.530 --> 07:15.330
It's okay, Popp. They're exhausted
from fighting and asleep, right?

07:15.330 --> 07:17.330
Let's not wake them.

07:17.330 --> 07:21.040
Besides, I'd like to stay here
a little longer.

07:21.370 --> 07:22.330
Huh?

07:24.880 --> 07:27.970
<i>S-Something smells sweet.</i>

07:27.970 --> 07:30.550
<i>I feel woozy.</i>

07:36.510 --> 07:37.430
Popp...

07:38.430 --> 07:43.150
<i>I-I can't believe it.
Maam would never do this.</i>

07:44.190 --> 07:45.520
Popp...

07:46.230 --> 07:47.570
Maam...

07:49.190 --> 07:50.360
Goodnight!

07:51.950 --> 07:53.530
What are you doing, Maam?!

07:54.490 --> 07:56.710
I've brought a friend with me.

07:56.710 --> 07:57.460
What?!

07:57.460 --> 07:58.790
I'll introduce you.

08:00.700 --> 08:02.800
H-Hadlar?!

08:02.800 --> 08:04.210
Then you're...!

08:09.550 --> 08:10.930
I've heard of you!

08:10.930 --> 08:13.600
I'm Mystic Bishop Zaboera.

08:13.600 --> 08:18.730
You were on guard, so I borrowed
Maam's likeness with a Morph spell.

08:18.730 --> 08:23.140
I was told you're quite fond of the girl.

08:23.520 --> 08:25.850
Y-You dirty...

08:28.150 --> 08:29.910
So it worked.

08:29.910 --> 08:30.860
Yes.

08:31.900 --> 08:33.990
<i>I can't move!</i>

08:33.990 --> 08:36.910
What did you do to me?!

08:38.740 --> 08:44.250
My body contains hundreds of poisons.

08:44.250 --> 08:50.340
I injected the most potent
neurotoxin through my claws.

08:51.340 --> 08:52.970
Everybody...!

08:53.470 --> 08:56.800
Give it up! You can't even scream now!

08:57.390 --> 08:58.520
Besides...

08:58.520 --> 09:03.020
thanks to the Dark Incense
I've been diffusing,

09:03.020 --> 09:06.780
everybody's in a slumber
deeper than the ocean!

09:06.780 --> 09:10.910
You can assassinate
all of them now, Lord Hadlar.

09:10.910 --> 09:12.280
Good.

09:14.030 --> 09:18.950
I didn't expect this one
to resist the Dark Incense, though.

09:18.950 --> 09:22.120
Perhaps he's gained some special power.

09:22.120 --> 09:25.090
That's the Disciples of Avan for you.

09:25.090 --> 09:29.880
They gain power when you're not watching
and bare their fangs.

09:30.670 --> 09:33.710
I should kill him here.

09:34.130 --> 09:36.010
I'm disappointed, Hadlar.

09:36.010 --> 09:36.760
What?!

09:37.090 --> 09:40.940
You were always cruel,
but you never played dirty!

09:40.940 --> 09:47.440
We've fought before, but you always had
the dignity of the Dark Lord!

09:47.770 --> 09:53.190
And now you're resorting
to the dirty tricks of this old gremlin!

09:53.730 --> 09:56.120
Oh how the mighty have fallen!

09:56.120 --> 09:58.790
Shut up!

09:58.790 --> 10:04.370
I cannot fail again! I don't have
the luxury of choosing my methods!

10:05.080 --> 10:09.830
You know,
Crocodine once said the same thing.

10:10.250 --> 10:13.000
But in the end, he realized the truth!

10:13.460 --> 10:19.550
There are more important things
than winning or losing!

10:20.890 --> 10:23.850
You think you can lecture Lord Hadlar?!

10:24.220 --> 10:26.770
I'll finish you myself!

10:26.770 --> 10:30.020
A few more pricks and I'm sure you'll die!

10:32.730 --> 10:35.570
Time to die!

10:37.150 --> 10:37.900
What?!

10:40.160 --> 10:42.910
Get your grubby little paws off of him!

10:42.910 --> 10:45.740
Wh-Who are you?!

10:46.910 --> 10:50.370
Mentor... Matoriv!

10:54.090 --> 10:56.630
SIZZLE
HEAT-TYPE SPELL

10:59.050 --> 11:01.640
DARK INCENSE

11:02.220 --> 11:04.350
Wh-Who are you?!

11:04.350 --> 11:06.560
Mentor... Matoriv!

11:08.180 --> 11:13.940
Moron, you let them trick you.
You need to work on your perception.

11:13.940 --> 11:15.110
Sorry, Mentor.

11:15.110 --> 11:21.780
Remember, a Mage must always be
the most level-headed in the party.

11:22.240 --> 11:24.370
Even when everybody's worked up,

11:24.370 --> 11:28.880
you need to stay cool as ice
and understand the situation.

11:28.880 --> 11:33.210
At least that was what I did
when working with Avan.

11:34.040 --> 11:36.170
Now I remember!

11:36.670 --> 11:40.350
You sided with Avan and resisted me!

11:40.350 --> 11:44.430
You called yourself
the most powerful human Grand Sorcerer!

11:44.430 --> 11:47.980
Yo, you seem well,
you third-rate Dark Lord.

11:47.980 --> 11:49.480
What did you call me?!

11:49.480 --> 11:54.240
You wouldn't just die
so now I have to play clean-up.

11:54.240 --> 11:58.160
Plus you killed one of my only friends.

11:58.160 --> 12:01.660
He was a good guy. He really was.

12:01.660 --> 12:05.410
And he wasn't even a third of my age.

12:05.410 --> 12:09.670
Roka... Avan... All the good ones die.

12:09.670 --> 12:13.460
And crooks like you and me
end up surviving.

12:13.460 --> 12:15.750
What an ugly world.

12:18.840 --> 12:24.600
I'll make you a deal. I'll send you
to the afterlife, so go apologize to Avan!

12:24.600 --> 12:26.390
Shut up, you old fossil!

12:27.220 --> 12:30.770
I'll reduce all of you to ash!

12:31.310 --> 12:32.390
Sizzle.

12:33.810 --> 12:34.650
What?!

12:36.810 --> 12:38.240
Squelch.

12:38.240 --> 12:40.320
<i>Two spells at once?!</i>

12:42.820 --> 12:47.660
<i>He's not healing right away.
They got him with a powerful poison.</i>

12:49.080 --> 12:50.540
Don't get cocky!

12:52.660 --> 12:54.540
How about this?!

12:55.870 --> 12:57.880
Kasizz!

12:59.550 --> 13:03.090
I-Impossible! There's no way!

13:04.550 --> 13:06.220
Kasizz!

13:15.190 --> 13:20.030
H-How can a mere human use Kasizz?!

13:20.030 --> 13:25.030
Did you think you had a patent?!
Get over yourself!

13:28.030 --> 13:32.540
<i>I'm losing!
Is his Magic Power greater than mine?!</i>

13:33.700 --> 13:35.040
Zaboera!

13:35.040 --> 13:37.420
Hurry up and help me!

13:39.340 --> 13:41.260
This is for my arm!

13:41.260 --> 13:42.550
Sizzle!

14:03.570 --> 14:08.660
I wish I was younger!
My body can't keep up with the spell!

14:09.280 --> 14:12.710
<i>N-No! My mentor is in danger!</i>

14:12.710 --> 14:16.880
<i>At this rate everyone in the shack
will die, too!</i>

14:16.880 --> 14:21.340
<i>No! Everyone, wake up! Please wake up!</i>

14:21.340 --> 14:26.090
<i>Big guy! Hyunckel! Princess! Dai!</i>

14:26.550 --> 14:28.220
<i>Dai!</i>

14:32.140 --> 14:34.480
Seems you've reached your limit.

14:34.480 --> 14:38.890
In the end, you're the one
who'll be seeing Avan!

14:50.660 --> 14:52.070
We did it!

15:04.170 --> 15:05.380
Dai?!

15:08.590 --> 15:09.560
Dai!

15:09.560 --> 15:10.760
Dai!

15:10.760 --> 15:13.230
You're supposed to be asleep!

15:13.230 --> 15:16.190
I heard Popp calling me!

15:16.190 --> 15:17.610
That's impossible!

15:17.610 --> 15:22.610
Begone, Hadlar!
I'll never let another friend die!

15:22.610 --> 15:24.780
Curse you!

15:24.780 --> 15:27.660
Not one more friend!

15:27.660 --> 15:31.990
Sizzle!

15:56.310 --> 15:59.020
<i>He focused all his power into his fist,</i>

15:59.020 --> 16:03.190
<i>and reflected their Sizzle spells
with his own Sizzle spell.</i>

16:03.650 --> 16:06.320
<i>Even I can't do that.</i>

16:08.530 --> 16:09.410
Are you okay?!

16:09.410 --> 16:10.820
Y-Yeah.

16:10.820 --> 16:12.200
You did it!

16:12.200 --> 16:16.910
You hit them with all that Heat Energy.
Hadlar must be done for sure.

16:16.910 --> 16:20.950
I don't know.
He's pretty tenacious.

16:22.830 --> 16:26.170
Sorry. You had to save me again.

16:26.960 --> 16:31.680
But... But you know,
I appreciate what you said.

16:31.680 --> 16:34.640
"I'll never let another friend die."

16:38.720 --> 16:40.560
You softies.

16:41.310 --> 16:43.230
What happened?

16:43.770 --> 16:45.730
Th-This is...!

16:45.730 --> 16:50.870
Did we sleep through
an explosion of this size?!

16:50.870 --> 16:53.080
Zaboera and Hadlar showed up.

16:53.080 --> 16:54.660
W-What?!

17:01.410 --> 17:04.380
I managed to get away with a Zoom spell.

17:04.380 --> 17:06.710
Those filthy little brats!

17:07.460 --> 17:10.930
I doubt Hadlar survived that.

17:10.930 --> 17:14.760
After all the help I gave him,
he's useless!

17:14.760 --> 17:17.680
I'll have to ingratiate myself
with Mystvearn...

17:21.020 --> 17:22.860
Lord Hadlar?!

17:22.860 --> 17:26.780
Zaboera, I won't let you betray me!

17:26.780 --> 17:30.360
You and I are in the same boat now!

17:30.360 --> 17:35.650
If you try latching on
to someone else, I'll kill you!

17:36.030 --> 17:43.130
I know about your secret research
about Superior Beings!

17:43.130 --> 17:46.880
-What?!
-It's time to use that research for me!

17:46.880 --> 17:47.760
Why?!

17:47.760 --> 17:52.170
The Disciples of Avan
are growing fast! Too fast!

17:52.840 --> 17:57.340
This body King Vearn gave me
isn't enough to keep up!

17:57.970 --> 18:00.640
I need greater power!

18:00.640 --> 18:04.560
Power like that Dragonoid Baran!

18:04.560 --> 18:12.150
I need the greatest power in the world
beyond anyone else!

18:13.190 --> 18:17.660
I see. That explains
the Crest on your hand.

18:17.660 --> 18:19.410
It's impressive power.

18:19.780 --> 18:22.080
I'm alive thanks to you.

18:22.660 --> 18:27.340
We're sorry. We fell into a trap
by Zaboera of all people.

18:27.340 --> 18:29.380
Don't beat yourself up over it.

18:29.380 --> 18:34.380
Somebody even had their feelings
manipulated and got all spoony.

18:36.760 --> 18:41.430
I can't believe Hadlar
actually participated in Zaboera's scheme.

18:41.430 --> 18:43.810
He was always one
who preferred brute force.

18:43.810 --> 18:46.520
He probably realized
brute force wouldn't work.

18:46.520 --> 18:52.060
Since it turns out the Hero is the son of
the legendary Dragon Knight.

18:52.270 --> 18:54.700
He must have been pretty desperate.

18:54.700 --> 18:58.320
I think something big is going on
within the Dark Army.

19:00.200 --> 19:04.370
Hey, Mentor, you knew
Dai is a Dragon Knight, didn't you?

19:04.370 --> 19:05.040
Yeah.

19:05.040 --> 19:08.340
You should have told us sooner!

19:08.340 --> 19:11.960
Plus you could've shown up sooner,
couldn't you?!

19:14.090 --> 19:20.810
I knew learning the fate of the
Dragon Knight would hurt you mentally.

19:20.810 --> 19:23.520
There's nothing I can do
to help with that.

19:23.520 --> 19:28.690
I figured only one person could help,
so I dug this up.

19:28.690 --> 19:30.940
What's this dirty book... Huh?!

19:32.020 --> 19:34.360
This mark... Is it...?!

19:34.360 --> 19:35.740
Master Avan's!

19:35.740 --> 19:39.070
That's right.
This is the famous Book of Avan.

19:39.070 --> 19:40.280
The Book of Avan?!

19:40.700 --> 19:42.870
Avan, the Hero who saved the world,

19:42.870 --> 19:47.830
wrote of his skills, spells, and thoughts
for future generations.

19:47.830 --> 19:50.920
It's the only hand-written book of his.

19:50.920 --> 19:54.300
I never knew there was such a book.

19:54.300 --> 19:57.930
It was stored in the Library of Carl,
his home country.

19:57.930 --> 20:00.630
I figured you'd need it more.

20:01.510 --> 20:04.470
Check the Book of Air, page 192.

20:05.930 --> 20:11.320
The Book of Earth is about combat skills.
Sea covers Aura skills and spells.

20:11.320 --> 20:14.610
And the Book of Air is of the soul.

20:15.150 --> 20:16.440
Uh...

20:16.440 --> 20:18.980
"To the... and..."

20:21.110 --> 20:24.410
Leona, can you read it?
I can't read a lot of the words.

20:26.200 --> 20:28.790
"To the wounded and lost.

20:29.160 --> 20:33.090
Defeat is not to fall from your wounds.

20:33.090 --> 20:37.710
It is when you lose yourself
after falling.

20:38.460 --> 20:40.460
<i>Be strong of heart.</i>

20:40.920 --> 20:47.300
<i>Calmly consider your goals
and your abilities.</i>

20:48.220 --> 20:51.310
<i>We are all limited in what we can do.</i>

20:51.310 --> 20:55.190
<i>When each of us does the best we can do,</i>

20:55.190 --> 21:01.690
<i>even when on the edge of despair,
the path to victory shall shine through."</i>

21:02.570 --> 21:06.620
<i>It's almost like Master is here
reassuring us.</i>

21:07.200 --> 21:10.200
<i>Those were just the words
we needed to hear.</i>

21:11.250 --> 21:12.630
<i>Avan...</i>

21:12.630 --> 21:17.840
It's just the item
for green little fledglings like you.

21:17.840 --> 21:19.510
Take good care of it.

21:19.510 --> 21:21.590
Thank you, Matoriv.

21:22.510 --> 21:25.380
"Your goals and abilities..."

21:27.050 --> 21:28.600
Let's return to Papnica.

21:29.560 --> 21:33.440
I want to do the best that I can do.

21:33.440 --> 21:37.860
Something more for the world
than just fighting with you.

21:38.560 --> 21:40.980
Something only I can do!

21:52.870 --> 21:56.040
Dai! We're going!

21:56.540 --> 21:57.670
Okay!

22:04.470 --> 22:07.430
<i>Even if you face the devil
With logic on your side</i>

22:04.470 --> 22:07.430
<i>tatoe akuma ni seiron kazashite
mukatte mitemo</i>

22:07.590 --> 22:11.390
<i>It may just be a rationalization</i>

22:07.590 --> 22:11.390
<i>sore wa akumade seitouka
sashite chigai wa naikamo</i>

22:11.560 --> 22:15.480
<i>Even now, even now I waver</i>

22:11.560 --> 22:15.480
<i>ima mo ima mo yureteiru kedo</i>

22:15.640 --> 22:19.520
<i>How far will we go?</i>

22:15.640 --> 22:19.520
<i>bokura wa dokomade yukuno</i>

22:19.690 --> 22:22.820
<i>I heard a voice like an angel's whisper</i>

22:19.690 --> 22:22.820
<i>tenshi no sasayaki nimo nita
koe ga kikoeta</i>

22:22.980 --> 22:26.740
<i>Maybe it was an imposter's illusion
It still rang in my ears</i>

22:22.980 --> 22:26.740
<i>hatamata petenshi no mayakashi
hitokiwa mimi ni hibiiteita</i>

22:26.900 --> 22:30.450
<i>Exposed to love and sorrow</i>

22:26.900 --> 22:30.450
<i>ai ni hiai ni sarasare nagara</i>

22:30.620 --> 22:34.750
<i>On the path strewn with pride</i>

22:30.620 --> 22:34.750
<i>hokori mamire michi no tochu</i>

22:36.460 --> 22:38.790
<i>Fleeting moments of cowardice</i>

22:36.460 --> 22:38.790
<i>kiete wa ukabu touhikou</i>

22:40.330 --> 22:42.590
<i>The SOS I held back</i>

22:40.330 --> 22:42.590
<i>nomikonda SOS</i>

22:44.170 --> 22:48.180
<i>I clenched my trembling fist</i>

22:44.170 --> 22:48.180
<i>furueru te wo nigirishimeta</i>

22:48.760 --> 22:53.760
<i>That single little promise</i>

22:48.760 --> 22:53.760
<i>tatta hitotsu no chiisana yakusoku ga</i>

22:53.930 --> 22:57.560
<i>Those trivial little memories</i>

22:53.930 --> 22:57.560
<i>honno sasaina omoidetachi ga</i>

22:57.730 --> 22:59.850
<i>They're still in my heart</i>

22:57.730 --> 22:59.850
<i>itsumade tattemo kono mune wo</i>

23:00.020 --> 23:04.020
<i>As embers that keep me burning</i>

23:00.020 --> 23:04.020
<i>kogashi tsuzukeru tomoshibi ni naru</i>

23:04.190 --> 23:08.530
<i>A single transparent beam of light</i>

23:04.190 --> 23:08.530
<i>tada hitosuji no toumei na hikari ga</i>

23:08.700 --> 23:11.700
<i>Lights the way before me</i>

23:08.700 --> 23:11.700
<i>me no mae wo terashite yuku</i>

23:11.870 --> 23:16.370
<i>There is little that I can do</i>

23:11.870 --> 23:16.370
<i>boku ni dekiru koto wa ikutsu mo naisa</i>

23:16.540 --> 23:22.580
<i>Just keep on to the future
I managed to grasp through my faith</i>

23:16.540 --> 23:22.580
<i>shinjinuita saki ni te ni shita mirai wo
susunde yuke</i>

23:33.850 --> 23:37.930
<i>After returning to Papnica, Dai and
his friends prepare for their next battle.</i>

23:38.100 --> 23:41.650
<i>They learn of
a martial arts tournament in Romos,</i>

23:41.810 --> 23:46.480
<i>Hearing the victor can win a legendary
item, Dai and Popp head to Romos.</i>

23:47.030 --> 23:50.200
<i>As a contestant stands
in the Colosseum, being cheered on,</i>

23:50.610 --> 23:53.660
<i>Dai and Popp stare in astonishment.</i>

23:54.120 --> 23:56.290
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

23:56.450 --> 23:58.370
<i>"The Romos Martial Arts Tournament"</i>

23:58.540 --> 24:00.710
<i>The adventure continues!</i>

24:00.710 --> 24:02.710


24:02.710 --> 24:04.680

